  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :&nbsp;</strong><a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://exams.nta.ac.in/swayam/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">National Testing Agency (NTA)</a> </span>has released the admit card for the Study Webs of Active Learning for Young Aspiring Minds SWAYAM 2026 (January 2026 Semester) Examination on the official website of the NTA recently. The online application process for NTA SWAYAM January Online Form 2026 were accepted from 15 April 2026 to13 May 2026. The Examination is going to conducted on 17,18,19, 20 and 21 June 2026 Candidates must check the complete details for NTA SWAYAM Admit Card 2026, which are given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"code-block code-block-2\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">National Testing Agency (NTA)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">NTA SWAYAM January Admit Card 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>15 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>13 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>14 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Date :&nbsp;<strong>15-17 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Date : <b>17,18,19, 20 and 21 June 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam City Details : <b>09 June 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card : <strong>12 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">General : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>750/- (Add Course 600/-)</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">OBC NCL, EWS <b>: Rs. 500/- (Add Course 400/-)</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SC, ST, PH : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>500/-&nbsp;(Add Course 400/-)</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Examination Fee Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking, E Challan, E Wallet, Cash Card Fee Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>NTA SWAYAM Admissions 2026 : Age Limit</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><b>As per NTA Rules</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>NTA SWAYAM Admissions 2026 : Course Details</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Course Name&nbsp;</strong></span>: NTA Study Webs of Active Learning for Young Aspiring Minds SWAYAM.</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Exam Conduct</span>&nbsp;</strong>: National Testing Agency (NTA).</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>NTA SWAYAM Admissions 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.6594%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Course&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.3406%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Eligibility&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.6594%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">UG Courses</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.3406%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have 10+2 Exam Passed from Any Recognized&nbsp;Board in India.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.6594%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">PG Course</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.3406%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have Bachelor Degree Exam Passed from Any Recognized University in India.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.6594%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Certificate Course</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.3406%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates 10+2 Exam Passed from Any Recognized&nbsp;Board in India.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>NTA SWAYAM Admissions 2026 : Exam District</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><b>Uttar Pradesh :</b>&nbsp;Agra, Aligarh, Ayodhya, Bareilly, Etawah, Gorakhpur, Jhansi, Kanpur, Lucknow, Meerut, Moradabad, Orai, Prayagraj, Varanasi, Greate Noida, Lakhimpur, Sitapur and Basti.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><b>Bihar :</b>&nbsp;Arrah, Aurangabad, Begusarai, Bhagalpur, Chhapra, Darbhanga, Dehri, Gaya, Motihari, Muzaffarpur, Patna, Purnea, Raniganj &amp; Saharsa,</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><b>Madhya Pradesh :</b>&nbsp;Barwani, Bhopal, Chhattarpur, Guna, Gwalior, Hoshangabad, Indore, Jabalpur, Jhabua, Khandwa, Khargone, Mandsaur, Rewa, Satna, Seoni, Shahdol &amp; Sagar.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><b></b><b>New Delhi :</b>&nbsp;Delhi</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><b>Rajasthan :</b>&nbsp;Kota, Ajmer, Alwar, Banswara, barmer, Bharatpur, Bikaner, Chittorgarh, Dungarpur, Jaipur, Jodhpur, Nagaur, Pratapgarh, Sikar, Sriganganagar &amp; Udaipur.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For more Other State Exam District Details Read the Notification.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download NTA SWAYAM January Admit Card 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In order to download their NTA SWAYAM Admit Card candidates are required to go to the important link section provided below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After getting the link candidates need to click it for downloading their NTA SWAYAM Admit Card.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates need to provide their following details-:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Registration No. /Roll No.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>DOB/Password</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Captcha Code(if specified)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After providing their details appropriately candidates will be able to check their NTA SWAYAM Admit Card.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates can also check their NTA SWAYAM Admit Card from official site of the NTA.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>NTA SWAYAM Application Form 2026 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Selection will be based on </span>Entrance Test.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong><