26 been released?</strong><br>\n<strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>Yes the NTA SWAYAM Admit Card 2026 has been released.</p>\n<p><strong>Q. When was the NTA SWAYAM Admit Card 2026 officially announced?</strong><br>\n<strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>The NTA SWAYAM Admit Card 2026 has issued on 09 June 2026 by NTA.</p>\n<p><strong>Q. When will the NTA SWAYAM exam be held?</strong><br>\n<strong>Answer.</strong> The NTA SWAYAM examination will be conducted in <strong>17,18,19,20 and 21 June 2026</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>Q. Where can I check the NTA SWAYAM Admit Card 2025?</strong><br>\n<strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>You can check it on the official NTA website: <span style=\"color: #000000;\">exams.nta.ac.in/swayam</span></p>\n<p><strong>Q. What details are required to download the admit card?</strong><br>\n<strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>Candidates need their&nbsp;<strong>Registration Number / Roll Number</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>Password / Captcha</strong>&nbsp;to download the admit card<strong>.</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What is NTA SWAYAM Official Website?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>The Official Website of NTA SWAYAM is https://exams.nta.nic.in/swayam/</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
